{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/8098-aeonverse-metaplot-summary","id":8098,"title":"Aeonverse Metaplot Summary?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-11T08:10:58-08:00","id":8098,"title":"Aeonverse Metaplot Summary?","content":"I was just reading the &quot;the story so far&quot; summary in the back of the softcover version of Trinity, and was wondering if there is a complete summary of the plot of the original three games somewhere I can read up on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/373-infernal-teddy","name":"Infernal Teddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar373_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T15:48:23-08:00","id":8421,"title":"","content":"There is a time line in Adventure but I really can't recall a brief or even not so brief summary. The metaplot however is changing the world's are changing things that were once stone and fixed may not be so firm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T23:05:15-08:00","id":8632,"title":"","content":"The best summary of the events that link all three games is in <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/File:AsiaAscendant.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Asia Ascendant&quot;</a> (specifically the section about the Venezuelan Phenomenon). An important note, in addition to what AA has to say, is that Michael Donighal was present at the original Hammersmith Incident, where he received nova-level powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-11T18:29:37-08:00","id":47176,"title":"","content":"Here's a foggy timeline without the time<br /> <br /> 1920s Maxwell Mercer goes to the future meets the board of directors of the Aeon Society. He goes back to found the Aeon Society which is your basic League of Pulp Heroes.<br /> <br /> The Hammersmith Explosion either creates Adventurers or it was the first Act by an Adventurer, either way everyone there seems to get powers with more people joining the fun quickly.<br /> Awesome Zepp Battles and Fisticuffs with Evil Carnivals abound.<br /> <br /> 1940s The Age of Adventure dies down? This is unclear cuz Adventurer only had one book and anything pre1998 was kept a mystery before then.<br /> <br /> 1998 Galatea (a satellite) explodes, an Adventurer most likely engineered the event to create superhumans.<br /> <br /> 2008 Setting start for Aberrant Capes are the new celebrities. There is a terrorist movement that claims Novas are nation states unto themselves since humans are too unevolved to create laws that can realistically regulate the new Nova reality. Project Utopia harnesses the power of Novas for the betterment of all, of course there are claims they are secretly trying to kill off Novas to make the world safe for mankind. <br /> <br /> They are. <br /> <br /> Some Time After That a war between Novas and Humans Erupts and humanity wins a pyrrhic victory and inherits a ruined Earth. Noetics (low level psychics) help save the Earth, colonize the stars and meet new alien beings. <br /> <br /> I forget how things went wrong in the future, but that's Trinity for you.<br /> <br /> <br /> Not the best sales pitch, I'm off to see Mitty but I just wanted to hit the highlights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1871-zen-bullet","name":"zen bullet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T12:21:44-07:00","id":163885,"title":"","content":"I admit I actually set my game back a few years, so that I could use events summed up in 2120 (on that other wiki) to base news events and such off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Man's unfailing capacity to believe what he prefers to be true rather than what the evidence shows to be likely and possible has always astounded me. We long for a caring Universe which will save us from our childish mistakes, and in the face of mountains of evidence to the contrary we will pin all our hopes on the slimmest of doubts. God has not been proven not to exist, therefore he must exist.</i> <b>--Academician Prokhor Zakharov</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3246-galaxy-master-zhad","name":"Galaxy Master Zhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3246_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}